{"book":"psalms","num":69,"verses":[{"en":"Save me, O God; for the waters are come in unto my soul.","n":1,"sm":"Ua tatalo Tavita ia","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"","sm":"tatalo"},{"en":"","sm":"Tavita"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"}]},{"en":"I sink in deep mire, where there is no standing: I am come into deep waters, where the floods overflow me.","n":2,"sm":"faaolaina ia i e ua ita ia te ia Ma le","w":[{"en":"","sm":"faaolaina"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"ita"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"Ma"},{"en":"","sm":"le"}]},{"en":"I am weary of my crying: my throat is dried: mine eyes fail while I wait for my God.","n":3,"sm":"usu pese i susana.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"usu"},{"en":"","sm":"pese"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"susana."}]},{"en":"They that hate me without a cause are more than the hairs of mine head: they that would destroy me, being mine enemies wrongfully, are mighty: then I restored that which I took not away.","n":4,"sm":"O le salámo a Tavita. Le Atua e, ia e faaola mai ia te au; auà o aʻu nei,","w":[{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"salámo"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"Tavita."},{"en":"","sm":"Le"},{"en":"","sm":"Atua"},{"en":"","sm":"e,"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"faaola"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"au;"},{"en":"","sm":"auà"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"aʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"nei,"}]},{"en":"O God, thou knowest my foolishness; and my sins are not hid from thee.","n":5,"sm":"a malemo lava aʻu i le vai.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"malemo"},{"en":"","sm":"lava"},{"en":"","sm":"aʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"vai."}]},{"en":"Let not them that wait on thee, O Lord GOD of hosts, be ashamed for my sake: let not those that seek thee be confounded for my sake, O God of Israel.","n":6,"sm":"O le a a'u goto i le palapala loloto,","w":[{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"a'u"},{"en":"","sm":"goto"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"palapala"},{"en":"","sm":"loloto,"}]},{"en":"Because for thy sake I have borne reproach; shame hath covered my face.","n":7,"sm":"e le o i ai se mea e tu ai;","w":[{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"se"},{"en":"","sm":"mea"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"tu"},{"en":"","sm":"ai;"}]},{"en":"I am become a stranger unto my brethren, and an alien unto my mother's children.","n":8,"sm":"ua oo lava aʻu i mea loloto o le vai,","w":[{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"oo"},{"en":"","sm":"lava"},{"en":"","sm":"aʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"mea"},{"en":"","sm":"loloto"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"vai,"}]},{"en":"For the zeal of thine house hath eaten me up; and the reproaches of them that reproached thee are fallen upon me.","n":9,"sm":"ua lofia foi a‘u i le vaitafe.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"lofia"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"a‘u"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"vaitafe."}]},{"en":"When I wept, and chastened my soul with fasting, that was to my reproach.","n":10,"sm":"Ua lailoa lava aʻu i loʻu valaau;","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"","sm":"lailoa"},{"en":"","sm":"lava"},{"en":"","sm":"aʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"loʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"valaau;"}]},{"en":"I made sackcloth also my garment; and I became a proverb to them.","n":11,"sm":"ua fa loʻu leo;","w":[{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"fa"},{"en":"","sm":"loʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"leo;"}]},{"en":"They that sit in the gate speak against me; and I was the song of the drunkards.","n":12,"sm":"ua mole lava oʻu mata, a o faatalital","w":[{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"mole"},{"en":"","sm":"lava"},{"en":"","sm":"oʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"mata,"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"faatalital"}]},{"en":"But as for me, my prayer is unto thee, O LORD, in an acceptable time: O God, in the multitude of thy mercy hear me, in the truth of thy salvation.","n":13,"sm":"i atu aʻu i loʻu Atua. O e ua ʻinoʻino fua mai ia te au,","w":[{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"atu"},{"en":"","sm":"aʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"loʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"Atua."},{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"ʻinoʻino"},{"en":"","sm":"fua"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"au,"}]},{"en":"Deliver me out of the mire, and let me not sink: let me be delivered from them that hate me, and out of the deep waters.","n":14,"sm":"e toatele i latou i oʻu lauulu;","w":[{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"toatele"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"latou"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"oʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"lauulu;"}]},{"en":"Let not the waterflood overflow me, neither let the deep swallow me up, and let not the pit shut her mouth upon me.","n":15,"sm":"e malolosi lava o e fia fasiotia mai aʻu,","w":[{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"malolosi"},{"en":"","sm":"lava"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"fia"},{"en":"","sm":"fasiotia"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"aʻu,"}]},{"en":"Hear me, O LORD; for thy lovingkindness is good: turn unto me according to the multitude of thy tender mercies.","n":16,"sm":"o e'ita fua mai ia te au; o mea na ou le fao","w":[{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"e'ita"},{"en":"","sm":"fua"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"au;"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"mea"},{"en":"","sm":"na"},{"en":"","sm":"ou"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"fao"}]},{"en":"And hide not thy face from thy servant; for I am in trouble: hear me speedily.","n":17,"sm":"a ua ou toe avatua lava.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"ou"},{"en":"","sm":"toe"},{"en":"","sm":"avatua"},{"en":"","sm":"lava."}]},{"en":"Draw nigh unto my soul, and redeem it: deliver me because of mine enemies.","n":18,"sm":"Le Atua e, o oe lava ua e sil","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Le"},{"en":"","sm":"Atua"},{"en":"","sm":"e,"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"oe"},{"en":"","sm":"lava"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"sil"}]},{"en":"Thou hast known my reproach, and my shame, and my dishonour: mine adversaries are all before thee.","n":19,"sm":"afia mai loʻu valea; e le lilo foi","w":[{"en":"","sm":"afia"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"loʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"valea;"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"lilo"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"}]},{"en":"Reproach hath broken my heart; and I am full of heaviness: and I looked for some to take pity, but there was none; and for comforters, but I found none.","n":20,"sm":"aʻu agasala ia te oe. Io II 12 13 14 15 16 17 18 19 20","w":[{"en":"","sm":"aʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"agasala"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"oe."},{"en":"","sm":"Io"},{"en":"","sm":"II"},{"en":"","sm":"12"},{"en":"","sm":"13"},{"en":"","sm":"14"},{"en":"","sm":"15"},{"en":"","sm":"16"},{"en":"","sm":"17"},{"en":"","sm":"18"},{"en":"","sm":"19"},{"en":"","sm":"20"}]},{"en":"They gave me also gall for my meat; and in my thirst they gave me vinegar to drink.","n":21,"sm":"Le Alii e, le ATUA o “an, aua neʻi faamaina ona o au o e faatalitali atu ia te oe; le Atua o Isaraelu e, aua neʻi masiasi ona o au o e sailiili ia te oe. Aua ua faalumaina lava a“u ona o oe; ua ufitia oʻu mata i le ma. Ua fai aʻu ma tagata āumau i oʻu uso, ma tagata ese i le fanau a loʻu tina. Aua ua “aina lava aʻu i le manao tele i lou fale; ua oo mai foi ia te au faifaiga a e na faifaia oe. Ua ou tagi, ma ou anapogi, ua fai lea ma luma ia te au. Na ou ofu i le ie talatala ; ona faia lea o aʻu ma upu faatusa a i latou. Ua upuia aʻu e i latou o e nonofo i le faitotoa, ua fai foi ma pese a e inu ‘ava. A o aʻu, ou te tatalo ia te oe, le ALII e, i ona po o le alofa, le Atua e, ona o le tele o lou alofa, ia e tali mai ia te au i le faamaoni o le olataga mai ia te oc. Ia e laveai mai ia te au ai le palapala, aua neʻi ou goto ai; ia laveaiina aʻu i e ua “ino“ino mai ia te au, atoa ma vai loloto. Aua ne“ lofia aʻu i le vaitafe, aua foi neʻi tofatumoanaina aʻu i le mea loloto, aua foi neʻi punitia le gutu o le lua i luga o aʻu. Le Aw: e, ia e tali mai ia te au, aua e lelei lou alofa mai; ia e liuliu alo mai ia te au, e pei ona tele o lou alofa mutimuti vale. Aua neʻi “alo ou fofoga i lau auauna; aua ua ou puapuagaina; ia vave ona e tali mai ia te au. Ia e faalatalata mai i loʻu agaga e faaola mai ai; ia e laveai mai ia te au ana o e ita mai ia te au. O oe, ua e silafia le faalumaina o aʻu, ma le faamaina o aʻu, ma loʻu faamasiasiga; ua i ou luma o i latou uma o e ita mai ia te au. O le luma ua momomo ai loʻu loto, ua ta“ lava aʻu; ua ou faatalitali foi i se na te faamatalaloto mai, a e leai lava se tasi, ma ni e faamafanafana mai, a e leai se isi na ou maua. Na latoy avane le mea oona e fai maʻu mea e ‘ai; ua ou fia inu, ona latou avane ai lea o le vineta ou te inu ai.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Le"},{"en":"","sm":"Alii"},{"en":"","sm":"e,"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ATUA"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"“an,"},{"en":"","sm":"aua"},{"en":"","sm":"neʻi"},{"en":"","sm":"faamaina"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"au"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"faatalitali"},{"en":"","sm":"atu"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"oe;"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"Atua"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"Isaraelu"},{"en":"","sm":"e,"},{"en":"","sm":"aua"},{"en":"","sm":"neʻi"},{"en":"","sm":"masiasi"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"au"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"sailiili"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"oe."},{"en":"","sm":"Aua"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"faalumaina"},{"en":"","sm":"lava"},{"en":"","